    "text": "HooHacks 2026: HooHacks is in-person at UVA with fun tech workshops, networking opportunities, and prizes! We will provide travel reimbursement. Check out hoohacks.io for more! - Devpost\n\n# HooHacks 2026\n\n### HooHacks is in-person at UVA with fun tech workshops, networking opportunities, and prizes! We will provide travel reimbursement. Check out hoohacks.io for more!\n\nFind more hackathons View the winners\n\n###### Who can participate\n\n- Ages 18+ only\n- All countries/territories, excluding standard exceptions\n\nMar 21 – 22, 2026\n\nUniversity of Virginia School Grounds\n\nPublic\n\n| $3,800 in cash | 687 participants |\n| --- | --- |\n\nWelcome to HooHacks, the premier hackathon at the University of Virginia! At our in-person Hackathon, you will have 24 hours (starting on March 21st at 12 PM and ending on March 22nd at 12 PM) to ideate, construct, and showcase the product you build from scratch along with other developers, engineers, and designers.\n\nThis year, we will be awarding over $20,000 in prizes to winners in nine different prize tracks! Hackers are additionally considered for our best overall, best beginner, and special sponsor prizes. Note that all prizes listed include the cash value of prizes at the time they were bought.Along with the hackathon, we will be putting on technical and recreational workshops that all participants can attend. Examples of some of our workshops include:\n\n- Rock Painting\n- Midnight Piñata\n- Flash CTF Competition\n- Salsa\n- Lettuce Eating Competition\n\n"
